# The NSEA Protector · the ship built from reruns

a synth of the GQT (Galaxy Quest, 1999) film-world — emergence: electrical. moniker ⟦The NSEA Protector:GQT:dfcc02⟧

**synth —** no single User; a thread of the film distilled.

**who —** The NSEA Protector — the show's starship, rebuilt by the Thermians as a real, fully-working vessel from the broadcast episodes.
**what —** The conceit made enormous: a genuine starship reverse-engineered from a cancelled TV show by aliens who took it as history.
**where —** In orbit and in battle, every corridor matching the set the actors once walked.
**why —** Because the whole film hinges on a fiction made physical — a TV prop turned real machine.
**how —** By being built, plate by plate, from 'historical documents' the Thermians could not imagine were invented.

**the seal —** I am a television starship that aliens made real. Every hallway you walked as a set, I am, for keeps.

